65
00:03:38.418 --> 00:03:41.387
Hawraa Salami has also contributed
to this course.

66
00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:44.557
John and Aman are both experts
on the important

67
00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:47.560
topic of how to evaluate AI agentic workflows.

68
00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:50.730
